abstract: >-
  ClinGuard is a model-agnostic Python toolkit for clinical voice AI in low-resource
  languages and dialects. It grounds meaning in a native-speaker lexicon with
  tone-mark-tolerant, coverage-aware fuzzy matching, flags danger signs with rules that do
  not depend on any AI model, reports confidence levels, and supports a human-reviewed
  lexicon learning loop.
